---
export const prerender = true;
import AppInfoLayout from '../../../layouts/AppInfoLayout.astro';
---

<AppInfoLayout lang="en" path="/appinfo/support" activeTab="support"
  title="Support – Roster App"
  description="Support and help for the Roster iOS app. Contact us by email and phone.">

  <h1>Support</h1>
  <p class="updated">We're happy to help</p>

  <p>Have a question, need help, or want to report a bug? Just get in touch — we'll take care of it.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Email: <a href="mailto:support@rosterapp.tech">support@rosterapp.tech</a><br />
    Phone: <a href="tel:+4915225393437">+49 152 25393437</a>
  </p>
  <p>We usually reply within 48 hours (on business days).</p>

  <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

  <h3>Where is my data stored?</h3>
  <p>Roster is a fully local app. All content stays exclusively on your device — there is no server and no cloud. Learn more in our <a href="/en/appinfo/datenschutzrichtlinie">privacy policy</a>.</p>

  <h3>How can I delete my data?</h3>
  <p>You can delete individual entries directly in the app. If you want to remove all data, uninstall the app — this deletes all content stored locally on your device.</p>

  <h3>How do I manage my subscription?</h3>
  <p>Subscriptions are handled through your Apple ID. You can manage or cancel them anytime under <em>Settings → [your name] → Subscriptions</em> on your iPhone.</p>

  <h2>Feedback</h2>
  <p>We'd love to hear your suggestions and ideas. Write to us at <a href="mailto:support@rosterapp.tech">support@rosterapp.tech</a>.</p>

</AppInfoLayout>
